helter or retrieving proper rain gear from a pack.\n\n4. **Insulation Layer for Sleeping Pads**\nBefore placing a sleeping bag on a ground pad, lay multiple sheets of paper maps flat on the ground beneath the pad. The air trapped between the map’s fibers and",
